**/windows/**/Bundle/
**/windows/**/Generated Files/
**/windows/**/x64/
**/windows/Directory.Build.targets
**/.kotlin/

# Explicit local supplier inputs are pinned by vendor locks and retained separately from cache.
/Nelyx/skia/vendor/inputs/
/Nelyx/upstream
